    <title>Fish kebab tacos</title>
    <updated>2026-07-05T16:41:20.520372+00:00</updated>
    <content type="html">&lt;h1 style="text-align:center;font-family:sans-serif;"&gt;Fish kebab tacos&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;img src="https://www.strangerfoods.org/images/fish-kebab-tacos.webp" style="text-align:center;"/&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;p style="font-family:sans-serif;&gt;A Mexican-inspired dinner that’s fun to assemble at the table and just as fun to eat. Serve with your deliciously fresh pico de gallo to cut through on your hot, toasted tacos and the whole family will be having the best day ever.&lt;/p&gt;</content>
